## About SIS

SIS, the Swedish Standards Institute, is the Swedish national standards body. SIS issues Swedish standards (SS) and adopts European and international standards as Swedish standards (SS-EN, SS-ISO/IEC).

## Connection to regulations

Authority regulations often refer to standards issued by SIS, such as SS-EN 50110 for the operation of electrical installations.
